<title>USA: Greenfield Industries Inc Q3 net shrinks.</title>
<headline>Greenfield Industries Inc Q3 net shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>AUGUSTA, Ga. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>			   Three months ended     Nine months ended</p>
<p>				  Sept. 30,		  Sept. 30,</p>
<p>			  1996	   1995	     1996     1995</p>
<p> Net sales	 $121,370    $104,147	 $384,089 $315,365</p>
<p>Restructuring costs</p>
<p>			  4,000	   ---	    4,000	---</p>
<p> Operating income  10,954	15,638	   46,887   44,998</p>
